'''Salon pods''' were detachable pods used for diplomatic meetings,<ref name="Starfighters" /> and were situated on [[Consular-class light cruiser|''Consular''-class space cruisers]]<ref name="Episode I" /> and [[Consular-class cruiser (Charger c70 retrofit)|Republic frigates]].<ref name="Ambush" /> The pods were also meant to eject in emergency situations.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" />

